	(text "Normally, these solder jumpers should be shorted, so that the LDOs are supplying the main\npower rails. Otherwise, they can be left open and the supply headers can be powered."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 310.642 9.906 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "541e6f88-0181-4b0e-9a24-4ebdbcf86339")
	)
	(text "Normally jumpered to\nconnect XTAL but can\nbe used for direct\nclock input."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 77.724 129.794 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.889 0.889)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "6ddaed96-a812-4b7a-8e7c-175d05d586f3")
	)
	(text "Sensitive\ncrystal pins"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 369.316 241.046 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "9842ccb1-8401-4615-a393-1479c6046691")
	)
	(text "Optional?"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 39.37 125.984 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "9de32a15-6e7e-4666-aa63-d86716572c91")
	)
	(text "Datasheet is unclear what\nto do with EPad. Evidence\nsuggests it should be GND.\nThis large solder-jumper\nallows us to connect to\nGND or leave open."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 143.256 171.704 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right)
		)
		(uuid "aab3c54a-5b14-440f-9976-72a1063f29a5")
	)
	(text "HDMI I2C signals"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 65.532 96.266 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "ab3d8299-eff7-4041-ae76-780f7bafec27")
	)
	(text "Initially mostly just have footprints for parts we want to solder/test:\n* CH32X033\n* USB-C socket\n* ASIC interface: Mezzanine + headers + COB\n* MS7210\n* MS9288C + crystal\n* 4 level shifters\n* 3 LDOs (1.2V, 1.8V, 3.3V)\n* QSPI + header\n* HDMI\n* VGA socket"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 14.986 32.258 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.905 1.905)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "f8022c4a-1166-4ce2-b8a9-dab6cd7e08c4")
	)
	(text "NOTE:\nMight be OK to\nshort R17 and\nmake pulldowns\nDNP if MS9288C\nsupports 5V\nfrom HDMI"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 67.564 160.782 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify right)
		)
		(uuid "ffadc4c8-4f04-4cd7-9f73-55ed33f77e95")
	)
